cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use OpTurbo in your research, please cite it using
  the following metadata.
title: "OpTurbo"
authors:
  - family-names: Nabi Ghods
    given-names: Shayan
type: software
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23621604"
url: "https://github.com/ShayanNabiGhods/OpTurbo"
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  OpTurbo is a Windows desktop application for the design and
  optimization of ducted wind turbines. It automates an engineering
  workflow connecting FreeCAD geometry generation, SpaceClaim,
  ANSYS Meshing, and Fluent/BEM simulations, with a genetic
  algorithm for optimizing turbine designs based on power coefficient.